        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Early Access] Orbcraft Survivors is currently in development.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbcraft Survivors</strong> is a <strong>time survival game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, where you craft orbs and enhance them with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge the same orb</strong> to enhance it into a stronger form, and <strong>acquire, combine, and apply perks</strong> to maximize your power. Try different combinations to unleash <strong>overwhelming magic</strong> and survive the oncoming waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/816b56b50359e059bf575b70c6687b4c.avif?t=1787750191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras_big/816b56b50359e059bf575b70c6687b4c.avif?t=1787750191 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can equip up to <strong>6 or more orbs</strong>, each possessing a unique skill. Merge orbs to make them stronger, and <strong>unleash Level 3 orbs</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.poster.avif?t=1787750191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.webm?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.mp4?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/d9627992a3a3abd3b849c7f0d1ec149f.avif?t=1787750191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras_big/d9627992a3a3abd3b849c7f0d1ec149f.avif?t=1787750191 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 100 perk combinations</strong> available, every battle brings fresh strategies and creativity. Discover powerful synergies and <strong>test your luck and tactics</strong> for a unique experience in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.poster.avif?t=1787750191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.webm?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.mp4?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/47e7c13993540c11e683de3c549d60b2.avif?t=1787750191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras_big/47e7c13993540c11e683de3c549d60b2.avif?t=1787750191 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield each character’s unique skills</strong> at the right moment. Gather gold to unlock <strong>powerful talents</strong> and enhance your character’s potential. Invest wisely, break your limits, and become the last survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.poster.avif?t=1787750191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.webm?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.mp4?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Early Access] Orbcraft Survivors is currently in development.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbcraft Survivors</strong> is a <strong>time survival game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, where you craft orbs and enhance them with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge the same orb</strong> to enhance it into a stronger form, and <strong>acquire, combine, and apply perks</strong> to maximize your power. Try different combinations to unleash <strong>overwhelming magic</strong> and survive the oncoming waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/816b56b50359e059bf575b70c6687b4c.avif?t=1787750191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras_big/816b56b50359e059bf575b70c6687b4c.avif?t=1787750191 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can equip up to <strong>6 or more orbs</strong>, each possessing a unique skill. Merge orbs to make them stronger, and <strong>unleash Level 3 orbs</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.poster.avif?t=1787750191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.webm?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.mp4?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/d9627992a3a3abd3b849c7f0d1ec149f.avif?t=1787750191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras_big/d9627992a3a3abd3b849c7f0d1ec149f.avif?t=1787750191 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 100 perk combinations</strong> available, every battle brings fresh strategies and creativity. Discover powerful synergies and <strong>test your luck and tactics</strong> for a unique experience in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.poster.avif?t=1787750191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.webm?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.mp4?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/47e7c13993540c11e683de3c549d60b2.avif?t=1787750191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras_big/47e7c13993540c11e683de3c549d60b2.avif?t=1787750191 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield each character’s unique skills</strong> at the right moment. Gather gold to unlock <strong>powerful talents</strong> and enhance your character’s potential. Invest wisely, break your limits, and become the last survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.poster.avif?t=1787750191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.webm?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.mp4?t=1787750191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
